{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From a group of boys and girls, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> girls leave. There are then left two boys for each girl. After this <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> boys leave. There are then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> girls for each boy. The number of girls in the beginning was:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/2/492d174a955bbc386e5c85ecd50a94d4027b7ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 43 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 29 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"475\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us represent the number of boys <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and the number of girls <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>From the first sentence, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e267c7e8a7091fe80968e43503ab09062c4b11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(g-15)=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>From the second sentence, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eacfb465619d78cce5b64f0e77e3cf58419e4565.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(b-45)=g-15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Expanding both equations and simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed00308b742219e0c60dfa50104898cf9e419e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2g-30 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699df1067fee976f1303918ae0c5f20fd9b1debe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5b = g+210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3edf0668c3e7e32810bd191b5a3615ee0e6b2bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2g-30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e8721b48ea07d6ad3fc01e29bf0aefce6f8d01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(2g-30)=g+210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/93540efede9ac159d5c62e823486b77c19859a25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"98\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a